==Battleground==
*1 [[Karin Nekozuka (Enemy)|Karin Nekozuka]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~8.33 seconds<sup>200f~250f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Lineup used: LVL 20 Crazed Cat, Crazed Tank Cat, Crazed Sexy Legs Cat  LVL 30 Paris Cat, Awakened Bahamut, Bony bone + Biohazard Cat Combo ( Mr., Skelecat, Necromancer Cat)

Start the battle by spamming Crazed Cat and Crazed Tank Cat, and when you have enough money, buy Crazed Sexy Legs Cat.
Continue to meatshield troughthout the battle. When you have enough money, buy Awakened Bahamut, and also start spamming Paris Cat. This should win the battle.


